  "term": "tonic–clonic seizure",
  "definition": "A tonic–clonic seizure is a seizure affecting the whole brain that causes the person to lose awareness and have intense muscle jerking or stiffening. It may begin with an aura and is often followed by a period of confusion and marked tiredness.",
